{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills"},{"text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKILL.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-patterns.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Installing-the-skill","level":2,"text":"Installing the skill"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","level":3,"text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Requires ","type":"text"},{"code":"gh","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ≥ v2.90.0 (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code --scope user"],"syntax":"bash"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope user","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" installs to ","type":"text"},{"code":"~\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (loads in every project).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--scope project"},{"text":" installs to ","type":"text"},{"code":"<cwd>\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (commit it so the whole team gets it)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pin a version with ","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref@v1.2.3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". List tags with ","type":"text"},{"code":"git ls-remote --tags https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Other agents: pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"--agent codex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"--agent cursor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"--agent gemini-cli","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", etc. Run ","type":"text"},{"code":"gh skill install --help","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the full list.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"skillssh","level":3,"text":"skills.sh"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["npx skillsadd heirloomlogic\/skills"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indexes the same source repo. Works without a GitHub CLI install."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Manual-no-gh-no-npx","level":3,"text":"Manual (no `gh`, no `npx`)"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".claude\/skills\/"},{"type":"text","text":". Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and others use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".agents\/skills\/"},{"type":"text","text":". Pic